<title>FRANCE: FIGURE SKATING-ELTSOVA AND BUSHKOV TAKE PAIRS GOLD.</title>
<headline>FIGURE SKATING-ELTSOVA AND BUSHKOV TAKE PAIRS GOLD.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marina Eltsova and Andrei Bushkov of Russia won the gold medal in the pairs event at the European figure skating championships on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Mandy Woetzel and Ingo Steuer of Germany took the silver and Russians Elena Berezhnaia and Anton Sikharulidze of Russia the bronze.</p>
</text>
